  "description": "Modern 3-Bedroom House – Monastery Avenue, Cork\n\nModern three-bedroom house extending to approximately 110 sq. m., situated in a highly convenient location on Monastery Avenue, with easy access to Cork City Centre, UCC, Mercy University Hospital and Tyndall National Institute.\n\nThe property offers bright and well-designed accommodation throughout, providing generous living space in a convenient location close to the city.\n\nAccommodation includes three bedrooms, with an ensuite to the main bedroom, together with a main bathroom and downstairs WC and an an office/study room. \n\nDownstairs, the house offers a comfortable sitting room, dining room and a spacious modern kitchen with excellent storage and breakfast bar. The property is finished in contemporary décor with timber flooring throughout.\n\nOutside is a private, low-maintenance garden with decking, side access suitable for bicycle storage, and two off-street parking spaces.\n\nThe property is well located for the city, UCC, Tyndall and Mercy University Hospital, with Cork City Centre and UCC both approximately a 20-25 minute walk away, and Mercy University Hospital approximately 15 minutes on foot.\n\nA number of public transport options are also available within approximately a 5–10 minute walk, with services towards the city centre, CUH/Bishopstown, Mahon Point, Kent Station and Little Island.\n\nKey features:\n* Modern house, approx. 110 sq. m.\n* Three bedrooms\n* Main bedroom with ensuite\n* Main bathroom plus downstairs WC\n* Study / storage room\n* Sitting room and dining room\n* Spacious modern kitchen with breakfast bar and excellent storage\n* Private low-maintenance garden with decking\n* Side access suitable for bicycle storage\n* Two off-street parking spaces\n* Timber flooring throughout\n* High-spec insulation and Zoned gas central heating with BER B3\n* High-speed broadband available\n* Convenient to Cork City Centre, UCC, Mercy University Hospital and Tyndall\n* Good amenities and public transport links nearby\n\nAvailable from 5 October.\n\nBills are additional and include gas, electricity, refuse and broadband.\n\nReferences required.\n\nPlease email with some information about yourself and all the proposed occupants to enquire about the property and arrange a viewing.\n",
